EN:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}All right, Mayor, where were we?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Ah yes, this {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}town hall {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}will be your
base of operations.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I'm your secretary, and I'll be glad
to help you with whatever you need.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
I look forward to working with you!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Pekâlâ Başkan, nerede kalmıştık?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Evet, belediye{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} binası{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} çalışma
merkeziniz olacak. Ben{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
sekreterinizim; ihtiyacınız olan
her konuda size seve seve
yardımcı olurum. Birlikte{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
çalışmayı dört gözle bekliyorum!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Vedi la ferrovia in alto nella mappa?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Per raggiungere{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Via degli Acquisti{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},
attraversa i binari e vai verso nord.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Siehst du die Bahngleise im Norden?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Wenn du die überquerst, gelangst du
zur {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Einkaufsmeile{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.

EN:
