IT:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}ImmoNook{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} si trova
in {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Via degli Acquisti{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
