TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Nook's Homes{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, tren raylarının{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}
hemen{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} ötesindeki Ana Cadde'de.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
